      "content": "it's like i'm just... not there anymore. everyone just stopped talking. i look at my phone and there's nothing, no one even checks in. it's like i've been deleted from everyone's lives but i'm still stuck in this body. it feels so fake to keep existing when it's like i don't even exist to anyone else.",
