      "content": "That feeling of being separated from it all, as if through a pane of glass, is a terrible way to experience being alive. Whether or not you feel seen by others, your experience and your existence are intrinsically valid. Even if you are feeling invisible right now, there is value in your presence, and that value doesn't depend on external validation. Please consider talking to a professional who can help you begin to bridge that gap and find your footing again.",
